---
<ArticleLayout
  title="Natural Gas vs Propane Generators: Fuel Cost, Tanks & Runtime"
  description="NG vs propane for standby: consumption tables, hourly costs, tank sizes and runtimes, own-vs-rent math, meter capacity, outage reliability, and diesel context."
