>
  <AlertBox type="info" title="Estimates, labeled">Fuel prices move with EIA reports and seasons. Ranges below are 2024–2026 planning figures (EIA + industry sources, researched Oct 2026) — check your utility bill and local propane quotes for decisions. Consumption rows marked * are estimates; verify your exact model's spec sheet.</AlertBox>

    <figure class="not-prose my-6">
    <img src="/images/propane-tanks-home.webp" alt="Two above-ground propane tanks on concrete pads beside a home" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#e5e7eb]" />
